  "title": "Flowise sandbox escape to remote code execution (CVE-2026-69253)",
  "summary": "Flowise 3.1.2 and earlier ship a JavaScript sandbox (FlowiseAI/nodevm) that can be escaped by authenticated users supplying custom function/tool code, executing arbitrary code on the host (reported by elttam). Affects the flowise and flowise-components npm packages. Fixed in 3.1.3.",
